<div id="forDelivery">
    <h3>For Book Heroes</h3>
    <p class="fs-5">
        Once you have joined as a Book Hero through our <a href="/join_us">Join Us</a> page, you will be redirected to
        your
        personalized dashboard. From there, you can easily navigate to the "Your Deliveries" tab, there you can find
        currently open deliveries.
    </p>
</div>
<div id="receiveDeliveryOrder">
    <h4>Receiving Orders</h4>
    <p class="fs-5">
        Once the payment for an order is verified, the order will become open for delivery. All Book Heroes will have
        access to view these open orders.
</div>
<div id="deliverOrder">
    <h4>Delivering orders</h4>
    <p class="fs-5">
        To confirm your commitment to deliver an order, you must lock the order by changing its status using the "Set
        Status" button on the delivery order. By locking the order, you are confirming that you will deliver the order
        within 1 day.
    </p>
    <p class="fs-5">
        <span class="fw-bold">In case you are unable to deliver the order, simply refrain from locking it</span>.
        However, if you choose to proceed,
        please ensure you pick up the books from the seller's designated pickup address. The quantity of each book to be
        picked up will be clearly indicated in the order details.
    </p>
    <p class="fs-5">
        Once you have picked up the books, update the status of the order to "picked up." Now, it's time to deliver the
        books to the shipping address provided.
    </p>
    <p class="fs-5">
        After successful delivery, mark the status of the order as "delivered." Congratulations, you have completed the
        delivery process.
    </p>
    <p class="fs-5">
        By following these steps, you contribute to ensuring a smooth and efficient delivery experience for both sellers
        and buyers.
    </p>
    <p class="fs-5 fw-bold">
        Your dedication as a Book Hero is greatly appreciated.
    </p>
</div>